@startuml sd24_line_not_ready
!include ../style.iuml
title SD-24 Hold a line that is not ready (UC-24)
autonumber

actor Dispatcher as D
box "CTC Office process" #F7F9FC
participant "Notices /\nDispatchPanel" as UI
participant "CtcHost" as Host
participant "StubCtcOffice" as Model
end box
participant "Central Harness" as H
participant "Track Controller\n(Red)" as TC

TC --> H : wayside W2 (Red): ready = false,\nreason "no PLC program"
H -> Model : step (waysides input)
Model -> Model : ready_lines(waysides): a line is ready when a\nwayside on it has reported and all on it are ready\n→ Green ready, Red not
Model -> Model : Red: authority 0 ("not ready"), no grants,\nno train released from the yard,\nscheduled runs wait
Model --> H : outputs with nothing for Red: no suggestions,\nclosed blocks or switch commands
H -> TC : nothing from the CTC Office for Red
note over Model
  Green keeps running. Closures and switch
  commands made for Red are kept, not sent.
end note
UI -> Host : notices
Host --> UI : "Track Controller not ready on Red (W2: no PLC program) —\nnothing is sent to a line, and no train can be dispatched\non it, until every wayside on it has a PLC program."
UI -> D : notice
D -> UI : Dispatch train on Red
UI -> Host : dispatchTrain(...)
Host -> Model : dispatch(...)
Model --> Host : UnsafeActionError "The Red line's Track Controller\nis not ready (W2: no PLC program); ..."
UI -> D : the reason

...the programmer loads W2's PLC program...
TC --> H : W2: ready = true
H -> Model : step
Model -> Model : Red ready: everything kept goes out\nfrom this step
@enduml
